and libcurl.js (LGPL-3.0-or-later), so web/ is licensed under AGPL-3.0-only (see web/LICENSE).
Third-party notices are in web/THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.txt.

If you run a modified version of web/ as a network service you must offer your users its source
under the AGPL. The client shows a "Source" link for this; point it at your own fork when you
change it (see web/public/index.html).
